Package: sem4all
Title: Unified Structural Equation Modeling Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Miguel", "Mayol-Tur", email = "m00mayoltur@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Description: A unified framework for structural equation modeling that integrates multiple 
  methodologies (GSCA, PLS-SEM, CB-SEM) with AI-driven discovery capabilities. 
  Provides advanced features including Ridge/Elastic Net regularization, 
  Mahalanobis outlier detection, and automated model discovery.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
